    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 112.77,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, king Benjamin thought it was expedient,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.013,
      "end": 5.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after having finished speaking to the people,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.701,
      "end": 7.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should take the names",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 7.785,
      "end": 11.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of all those who had entered into a covenant with God",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.355,
      "end": 12.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to keep his commandments.",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.66,
      "end": 16.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was not one soul,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.719,
      "end": 18.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were little children,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.175,
      "end": 21.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but who had entered into the covenant",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 21.909,
      "end": 24.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had taken upon them the name of Christ.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 25.236,
      "end": 31.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, it came to pass that when king Benjamin had made an end of all these things,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.732,
      "end": 34.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had consecrated his son Mosiah",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.28,
      "end": 37.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be a ruler and a king over his people,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.246,
      "end": 40.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had given him all the charges concerning the kingdom,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.491,
      "end": 43.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also had appointed priests to teach the people,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 44.015,
      "end": 48.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might hear and know the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.421,
      "end": 51.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to stir them up in remembrance of the oath which they had made,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 52.177,
      "end": 54.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he dismissed the multitude,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 54.354,
      "end": 55.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they returned,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.067,
      "end": 58.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every one, according to their families,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 58.476,
      "end": 60.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to their own houses.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 60.874,
      "end": 63.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Mosiah began to reign in his father's stead.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 64.119,
      "end": 67.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he began to reign in the thirtieth year of his age,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 67.736,
      "end": 73.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "making in the whole, about four hundred and seventy-six years from the time that Lehi left Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 74.593,
      "end": 77.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Benjamin lived three years and he died.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 78.477,
      "end": 83.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Mosiah did walk in the ways of the Lord,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 83.951,
      "end": 87.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did observe his judgments and his statutes,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 87.196,
      "end": 91.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did keep his commandments in all things whatsoever he commanded him.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 92.056,
      "end": 96.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Mosiah did cause his people that they should till the earth.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 96.834,
      "end": 99.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also, himself, did till the earth,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 99.522,
      "end": 103.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby he might not become burdensome to his people,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 103.231,
      "end": 107.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might do according to that which his father had done in all things.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 107.776,
      "end": 112.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was no contention among all his people for the space of three years.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    }
  ]
}